[2026-09-12  19:35:44.414]  Started   Test Suite: Orcraft Tutorial  Test Group: Statuses and Results  Test: Status: Fail                 localhost
[2026-09-12  19:35:44.414]  Started   Test Suite: Orcraft Tutorial  Test Group: Statuses and Results  Test: Status: Error                localhost
