[2026-09-12  19:35:52.798]  Finished  Test Suite: Orcraft Tutorial  Test Group: Statuses and Results  Test: Status: Pass with Warning    PASS     8.121 s   3 of 5   localhost', "text") }}
<p>When the last test finishes, the item's whole log is appended and the batch prints its result:</p>
{{ codeblock.block('Parameter           | Value
